        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "H2L (0.25 mmol, 96 mg) was dissolved in EtOH (15 mL) in the presence of triethylamine (0.6 mmol, 84 μL), and then DyCl3·6H2O (0.25 mmol, 94 mg) was added under stirring. The yellow solution was stirred for 24 h and then filtered. Diethyl ether was allowed to diffuse slowly into the filtrate at ambient temperature. Yellow rhombic-shaped crystals were obtained after 2 weeks. Yield: 63 mg (42%). Manipulations were performed under ambient/aerobic conditions.",
